            "description": "## GET /course-progress/\n\nReturns all user course progress records with detailed progress stats.\n\n### Permission: Authenticated User\n### Token Type: User Token\n\n### Response Fields:\n| Field | Type | Description |\n|-------|------|-------------|\n| id | integer | Progress record ID |\n| user | object | User's id and email |\n| course | object | Course details |\n| videos_watched | array | List of watched videos |\n| started_at | datetime | When user started course |\n| completed_at | datetime/null | When course completed |\n| completion_percentage | float | % of videos watched |\n| total_videos | integer | Total videos in course |\n| completed_videos | integer | Number watched |\n| is_completed | boolean | All videos watched |\n| total_UserCourseStart | integer | Total progress records (all users) |\n| total_completed_UserCourseStart | integer | Total completed courses (all users) |"
          },
          "response": []
        },
