            "description": "## POST /course-progress/create/\n\nStart tracking a user's progress for a specific course. Creates a new progress record.\n\n### Permission: Authenticated User\n### Token Type: User Token\n\n### Important:\n- Each user can only have **one** progress record per course\n- Duplicate creation returns **400 Bad Request**\n\n### Request Body Fields:\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| user | integer | ✅ Yes | ID of the user enrolling |\n| course | integer | ✅ Yes | ID of the course to track |"
